    "title": "Accurate Scene Text Recognition with Efficient Model Scaling and Cloze Self-Distillation",
    "citation": "Andrea Maracani et al., 2025",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.16184",
    "authors": "Andrea Maracani; Savas Ozkan; Sijun Cho; Hyowon Kim; Eunchung Noh; Jeongwon Min; Cho Min; Dookun Park; Mete Ozay",
